  "prefLabel": "We 301.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 301.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish licensure requirements, qualifications, and application procedures for construction of water wells and installation of water well pumps.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for We 300) #12083 eff 3-1-17",
